    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is REGRET?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a world where dictatorship and tyranny have triumphed. As one of the regime\u2019s traitors, you are sent to prison to take part in the &quot;Reintegration&quot; program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brutal program selects only the strongest, the slyest, and the most ruthless to be allowed back into society. Stay sharp, stay decisive \u2014 and maybe, just maybe, you\u2019ll earn that tempting taste of freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1818d30ec45467482fc5a4f6dbbedb45.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=612 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1818d30ec45467482fc5a4f6dbbedb45.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1818d30ec45467482fc5a4f6dbbedb45.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regret</strong> is a psychological co-op elimination game for 4 players. Survival means making tough calls, betraying, bluffing, pressuring, and taking risks. In the end, only one can walk free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SETUP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down at a high-tech table with other participants. Different devices will appear in front of you \u2014 each with unique rules, explained by a professional narrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AN IMMERSIVE ATMOSPHERE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the oppressive world of totalitarian rule. Propaganda posters, authoritarian symbols, atmospheric locations, and an unforgettable sound design will pull you deep into the world of <strong>REGRET</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/48825a4d9343411730c3b1bfe48d7556.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP CONFRONTATION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s you<strong> versus</strong> the other victims of the regime. There\u2019s no fighting the system here, no chance to topple it \u2014 you\u2019ve already lost. Your only goal is simple: <strong>survive</strong>! Who will you team up with? Who can you trust? And how do you avoid being the last one left behind? Tension runs high until only <strong>one</strong> remains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1a732a9cc995f56d8308743416fc6d30.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VARIETY OF GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every round brings a new challenge, with more games added through updates. Enjoy a wide range of experiences with your friends \u2014 each designed to be unforgettable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0080e2d1e23e0256e82ba8d7227ff4fa.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOOD LUCK!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory takes more than logic or persuasion \u2014 sometimes, you\u2019ll have to put your faith in pure luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0b77672d4ff589374fe7d4db01138b9c.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0b77672d4ff589374fe7d4db01138b9c.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/0b77672d4ff589374fe7d4db01138b9c.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DICTATORSHIP!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where life is scored, and your fate can be decided by the spin of a wheel, one question remains: what are you willing to do to survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/a316cedb97a17ff76b79331c2b5edf0a.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=612 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/a316cedb97a17ff76b79331c2b5edf0a.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/a316cedb97a17ff76b79331c2b5edf0a.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is REGRET?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine a world where dictatorship and tyranny have triumphed. As one of the regime\u2019s traitors, you are sent to prison to take part in the &quot;Reintegration&quot; program.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This brutal program selects only the strongest, the slyest, and the most ruthless to be allowed back into society. Stay sharp, stay decisive \u2014 and maybe, just maybe, you\u2019ll earn that tempting taste of freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1818d30ec45467482fc5a4f6dbbedb45.poster.avif?t=1755533377\" width=612 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1818d30ec45467482fc5a4f6dbbedb45.webm?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/1818d30ec45467482fc5a4f6dbbedb45.mp4?t=1755533377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regret</strong> is a psychological co-op elimination game for 4 players. Survival means making tough calls, betraying, bluffing, pressuring, and taking risks. In the end, only one can walk free.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE SETUP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit down at a high-tech table with other participants. Different devices will appear in front of you \u2014 each with unique rules, explained by a professional narrator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589530/extras/b0e76c306de503d029089e869f9741b5.poster.avif?t=1755533377\"